  "notes": "Quick-action shots wait for a *new* confirmation (wait with new=true counts matching nodes against the screen before the request), because Actions history keeps earlier takes' confirmations. Model shots wait for 'Cancel response' to disappear and mark that span for compression. Every shot starts with launch/restart: that frame syncs the clip to the runner clock. Shots with offline=false run with airplane mode off; the runner switches it per shot over USB adb. device='second' shots record on --second-serial (none in the intro since S07B moved to the S23U browser). redact_env names env vars whose values (Nextcloud server and username) are located on screen and blurred by demo_edit.py.",
